<!DOCTYPE html> <html lang="en"> <head> <meta charset="UTF-8"> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"> <title>Hassan Zia | DevOps Startup</title> <style> * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; } body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; color: white; overflow: hidden; background: linear-gradient(-45deg, #0f172a, #111827, #0c4a6e, #172554); background-size: 400% 400%; animation: gradient 12s ease infinite; } @keyframes gradient { 0% { background-position: 0% 50%; } 50% { background-position: 100% 50%; } 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; } } .container { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 30px; } .card { width: 100%; max-width: 850px; padding: 55px; text-align: center; border-radius: 25px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); backdrop-filter: blur(15px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); animation: cardEntry 1.2s ease forwards; } @keyframes cardEntry { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(50px) scale(0.95); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); } } .rocket { font-size: 65px; animation: rocket 2s ease-in-out infinite; } @keyframes rocket { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-5deg); } 50% { transform: translateY(-15px) rotate(5deg); } } h1 { margin-top: 15px; font-size: 48px; letter-spacing: 1px; } .highlight { color: #38bdf8; } .subtitle { margin-top: 15px; font-size: 20px; color: #cbd5e1; } .tech-stack { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 35px 0; } .tech { padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 30px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4); color: #7dd3fc; transition: 0.3s; } .tech:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25); } .status { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 30px; background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4); color: #86efac; animation: pulse 2s infinite; } .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; background: #22c55e; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 15px #22c55e; } @keyframes pulse { 50% { box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.25); } } .database { margin-top: 25px; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 16px; } .database strong { color: white; } .footer { margin-top: 35px; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; } @media (max-width: 600px) { .card { padding: 35px 20px; } h1 { font-size: 34px; } .subtitle { font-size: 17px; } .rocket { font-size: 50px; } } </style> </head> <body> <div class="container"> <div class="card"> <div class="rocket">🚀</div> <h1> Welcome to <span class="highlight">Hassan Zia</span> </h1> <p class="subtitle"> Cloud & DevOps Engineering in Action </p> <div class="tech-stack"> <div class="tech">⚙️ Ansible</div> <div class="tech">🐳 Docker</div> <div class="tech">🗄️ MySQL</div> <div class="tech">☁️ Cloud</div> </div> <div class="status"> <span class="dot"></span> Application is Running </div> <p class="database"> Database: <strong>myappdb</strong> | User: <strong>{{ vault_mysql_user }}</strong> </p> <div class="footer"> Automated Deployment • Ansible • Docker • MySQL <br><br> Built by <strong>Hassan Zia</strong> </div> </div> </div> </body> </html>
